// The reader's own sheets. The notebook route's layout loads them for its
// windows; a page opened on another route (beside its conversation on the
// workspace home, a preview window) mounted this editor without them: the
// pages area was then a plain block -- no centring, no padding, no scroll --
// and the page stood against the window's left edge under the side rail

// order, the editor is complete wherever it is hosted, as the workbook and
// deck surfaces are (generatedPageSurfaces); the notebook route deduplicates.
// The page window's sheet comes after them there, and its blanket button
// rule (`.native-page-window button`) ties with the reader's `x button`
// rules on specificity: the later sheet wins, so it follows them here too,
// wherever a bundler places this group.
