          // The server stored this save's body but its replay refused the
          // record (readPdfNativeServerRefusal): a definite answer. It was
          
          // sent the same record again and was refused again -- and the
          // author operation stayed held, so the window read 保存中… and
          // every later edit queued behind it. Now the page goes back to its
